{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31740","headline":"和刘涵 · 贾岛","name":"和刘涵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"京官始云满，野人依旧闲。\n闭扉一亩居，中有古风还。\n市井日已午，幽窗梦南山。\n乔木覆北斋，有鸟鸣其间。\n前日远岳僧，来时与开关。\n新题惊我瘦，窥镜见丑颜。\n陶情惜清澹，此意复谁攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}